  "prefLabel": "Box 703.17 Offensive Behavior",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 703.17 Offensive Behavior. Throughout the event a promoter or fighter shall not display or play a theme that includes music, video, or any type of physical display that contains profanity, vulgar language, or any derogatory ethnic or sexist remarks. Anyone violating this rule shall be suspended from competing in or promoting combat sports in New Hampshire for 6 months.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24",
